Build translation maps with BTreeMap so the generated strings are deterministic.

rslib/i18n's build script concatenates each module's FTL sources with
`repos.values().join("")` and writes the language and module maps by iterating
these maps. HashMap iteration order is randomized per process, so every build
embedded the translations in a different order and the binary was never
byte-reproducible. BTreeMap iterates in key order; nothing else changes.

